 :why-this-is-a-measurement-and-not-a-summary
 "The reason the arm still reads :unmeasured has changed twice and now reads
  `nobody has aggregated them`. Aggregation could be a paraphrase of the two
  entries, and if it is, the arm should stay :unmeasured and the slice should
