  :M3 "Are the two amendments independent in what they buy? Exhibit a pair of
       finders the receipt-data field separates and the zero-mass field does not,
       and a pair the other way round -- or prove one of those pairs cannot exist.
       This is the aggregation claim: if each half separates exactly what the
       other does, the arm is one amendment, not two."
  :M4 "The joint mechanical cost, RECOMPUTED not copied: over all Lean files
       under mathlib4/DarkTower, count the construction sites of Receipt and of
